Folio

Parts of the PDF app are ported from Folio (https://github.com/Forward-Future/folio),
by Matthew Berman / Forward Future: night mode that keeps images in colour
(apps/pdf/src/renderer/night-images.ts), Back/Forward link history
(nav-history.ts), page bookmarks (bookmarks.ts), local version history
(apps/pdf/src/main/version-history.ts, VersionHistoryPanel.tsx) and Open from
URL with its pinned-address network guard (apps/pdf/src/main/url-open/,
OpenUrlDialog.tsx). Folio is distributed under the MIT License:

